1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,980
Hi, we are Team Rimlight.

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:05,937
We chose lunar landing sites: at the pole, light is power.

3
00:00:06,037 --> 00:00:10,426
Meet LunarSiteNav: compare Moon landing sites and dates in seconds.

4
00:00:10,526 --> 00:00:15,550
It draws the Sun and Earth over real terrain, from NASA Horizons and LOLA.

5
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:19,399
Shackleton's rim keeps the Sun but loses Earth for days.

6
00:00:19,499 --> 00:00:22,511
Launch slips? The trade-off updates instantly.

7
00:00:22,611 --> 00:00:26,960
Next, any lander team checks power and Earth link before it flies.

